import source_queries.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI language work
    members:
        step as an integer
        payload as a pointer to JSON value

class:
    patterns:
        UI language document
    members:
        document as a pointer to UI source document
        opened as a boolean
        uri as a string
        context as a string
        snapshot as a string
        revision as an integer
        project revision as an integer
        version as an integer
        next as a pointer to UI language document

class:
    patterns:
        UI language client
    members:
        root as a string
        phase as an integer
        project as a pointer to UI source project
        models as a pointer to UI language document
        model as a pointer to UI language document
        desired as a pointer to UI source document
        project context as a string
        profiles as a string
        token types as a pointer to JSON value
        token epoch as an integer
        query as a pointer to UI source query
        query generation as an integer
        query notification as a boolean
        replies as a pointer to JSON value
        reply index as an integer
        continuation as UI language work
        continuation phase as an integer

{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s document means: client's model's document
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s opened means: client's model's opened
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s uri means: client's model's uri
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s context means: client's model's context
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s snapshot means: client's model's snapshot
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s revision means: client's model's revision
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s project revision means: client's model's project revision
{a pointer to UI language client:client}'s version means: client's model's version

to get [the UI language model for] {a pointer to UI source document:document} [in] {a pointer to UI language client:client}:
    set model to client's models
    loop while model != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI language document):
        if model's document = document:
            return model
        set model to model's next
    set model to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI language document)
    set model's document to document
    set model's uri to document's uri
    set model's next to client's models
    set client's models to model
    return model

to [forget UI language models in] {a pointer to UI language client:client}:
    set model to client's models
    loop while model != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI language document):
        set next to model's next
        destroy the value at model
        deallocate model
        set model to next
    set client's models and client's model to @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI language document)

to [mark UI language models closed in] {a pointer to UI language client:client}:
    set model to client's models
    loop while model != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI language document):
        set model's opened to false
        set model to model's next

to get [a UI language client rooted at] {string:root}:
    set client to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI language client)
    set client's root to root
    set client's token types to a new JSON-RPC array
    set client's replies to a new JSON-RPC array
    return client

to [free UI language client] {a pointer to UI language client:client}:
    forget UI language models in client
    free client's token types
    free client's replies
    if client's continuation's payload != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to JSON value):
        free client's continuation's payload
    destroy the value at client
    deallocate client
